stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> draft : création (save_mandate_form)
  draft --> drop_pending : ajout à la liste de drop
  drop_pending --> dropped : drop (carte / listes)
  drop_pending --> assigned : attribution manuelle
  dropped --> assigned : prise en charge / attribution
  redrop --> assigned
  assigned --> in_progress : lancement par l'expert
  assigned --> redrop : retrait de l'attribution
  in_progress --> waiting_report : rapport envoyé
  in_progress --> suspended : abandon (motif)
  suspended --> redrop
  waiting_report --> closed : validation du rapport
  waiting_report --> redrop : rapport refusé
  closed --> [*]
  draft --> cancelled
  dropped --> cancelled
  cancelled --> [*]
